Hm... it's not so much generational any more.
I don't know any of the ancient ones/old guard.
And/xorxes/Robin/selkik/clsn/xalbo/Broca/treed/tene seem to have their
sub-generations, but collectively they are, to me, the older
generation, tailing off probably starting at selkik, then timos; xalbo
and kribacr kinda bridge the gap, finally coming to my generation.
Then we've got the WAAAAAAAVE of newbies that come in and disappear
like crazy. We've had some 20-30+ filter in and out over the past six
months... I kinda feel like, aside from kids like vensa and ctino,
I've been the last generation to really stick around. It's really nice
to see a lot of the older generation stepping forward and waking up.

Don't mind my generational marking as it's based on a combination of
experience, activity, and proficiency. So in my head there are people
that have been here for longer, but to whom I am a senior.

